decide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Build a filter from a static method such as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and refine it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity holds:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"drifter\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ghost\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","let moving = QueryFilter.with(Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)","let movingOrFrozen = QueryFilter.anyOf(.with(Velocity.self), .with(Frozen.self))","","let movingNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: moving).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\"]\"","","let movingOrFrozenNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: movingOrFrozen).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingOrFrozenNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\", \"statue\", \"ghost\"]\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass a filter to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/doc